    ],
    "text": "I, Dayasiri Jayasekera, the Minister of Sports by virtue of powers vested in me under Sections 32(b) and 33 of the Sports ActNo. 25 of 1973 do hereby suspend, with immediate effect, the registration of the Hocky Federation of Sri Lanka, which is theNational Federation for Hockey and as an interim arrangement, appoint Mr. Samasundara Ekanayake Rajawardene TennakoonMudiyanselage Saman Priyantha Bandara, Director General of the Department of Sports Development as competent authoritywith effect from 04.01.2018 to continue its functions and further order that the election be convened and held to elect newoffice-bearers to Hocky Federation of Sri Lanka for 2018.",
